{
  "id": "PSA.83",
  "number": "83",
  "bookId": "PSA",
  "reference": "Psaumes 83",
  "copyright": "Texte libre de droits",
  "verseCount": 19,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "83",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PSA 83"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "83",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 83:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cantique. Psaume d'Asaph.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 83:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ô",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.83.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.83.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "! ne garde pas le silence. Ne te tais pas, et ne te tiens pas tranquille, ô",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "✶Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.83.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.83.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 83:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Car voici, tes ennemis s'agitent, et ceux qui te haïssent lèvent la tête.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 83:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ils trament avec astuce des complots contre ton peuple, et ils consultent contre tes [fidèles] cachés.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 83:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ils ont dit : Venez, et exterminons-les, de sorte qu'ils ne soient plus une nation et qu'on ne fasse plus mention du nom d'Israël.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 83:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Car ils ont consulté ensemble d'un cœur, ils ont fait une alliance contre toi :",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 83:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Les tentes d'Édom, et les Ismaélites, Moab, et les Hagaréniens,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 83:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Guebal, et Ammon, et Amalek, la Philistie, avec les habitants de Tyr ;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 83:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Assur",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "aussi s'est joint à eux ; ils servent de bras aux fils de Lot. Sélah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 83:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fais-leur comme à Madian, – comme à Sisera, comme à Jabin au torrent de Kison,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 83:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qui ont été détruits à En-Dor, qui sont devenus du fumier pour la terre.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 83:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fais que leurs nobles soient comme Oreb et comme Zeëb, et tous leurs princes",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "comme Zébakh et comme Tsalmunna ;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 83:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Car ils ont dit : Prenons possession des habitations de",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.83.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.83.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 83:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mon",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.83.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.83.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "! rends-les semblables à un tourbillon",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", comme la balle devant le vent.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 83:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Comme le feu brûle la forêt, et comme la flamme embrase les montagnes,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 83:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ainsi poursuis-les par ta tempête, et épouvante-les par ton ouragan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 83:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Remplis leurs faces d'ignominie, afin qu'ils cherchent ton nom, ô",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Éternel",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.83.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.83.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 83:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qu'ils soient honteux et épouvantés à jamais, qu'ils soient confondus et qu'ils périssent ;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 83:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Et qu'ils sachent que toi seul, dont le nom est l'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Éternel",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.83.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.83.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", tu es le Très-haut sur toute la terre.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "PSA.84",
    "number": "84",
    "bookId": "PSA"
  },
  "previous": {
    "id": "PSA.82",
    "number": "82",
    "bookId": "PSA"
  }
}